  "body": "Positioned on the top floor of the highly sought-after La Residence De La Plage. This modern two-bedroom apartment presents an outstanding opportunity to secure an easy-care coastal residence or investment in one of Orewa's most desirable beach side locations. \r\n\r\nDesigned for comfortable, low-maintenance living, the apartment features two generous double bedrooms and a modern bathroom. The well-appointed open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming hub for everyday living and entertaining, flowing seamlessly to a sunny north-east-facing balcony where you can relax with your morning coffee and enjoy the fresh sea breeze. Two storage lockers, attic storage and a communal bike shed add to the appeal. \r\n\r\nThe secure gated complex, dedicated parking and coveted top-floor position further enhance the property, offering peace of mind and a lock-and-leave lifestyle that will attract homeowners, holidaymakers, and investors alike. \r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this property apart is its exceptional location. Just moments from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, you'll have the luxury of morning walks along the shoreline, refreshing swims, paddleboarding, and sunset strolls right on your doorstep. Beyond the beach, Orewa's vibrant town centre is only a short walk away, offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping, medical facilities, supermarkets, and everyday conveniences. The nearby estuary walkway, recreational amenities and easy motorway access further complement the relaxed yet connected lifestyle that makes Orewa such a sought-after destination. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a permanent home, a seaside retreat, or a smart investment in a high-demand coastal location, this apartment offers an enviable blend of beachside living, convenience, and long-term appeal.",
